%% frame: S9 Domain and integration events: one fact, in process and across services (design)
sequenceDiagram
    participant Svc as :PaidGroupDealService
    participant Pub as :ApplicationEventPublisher
    participant OLS as :OrderLifecycleSubscriber
    participant Out as :IntegrationOutboxWriter
    participant Relay as :OutboxRelayService
    participant Topic as domain-events «topic»
    participant Con as :SqsNotificationEventConsumer
    participant Hdl as :NotificationEventHandler

    critical settlement transaction, REQUIRED, READ COMMITTED, 10 s (commerce-svc)
        Svc->>Pub: publishEvent(event: TeamSucceeded)
        Pub-->>Svc: registered, no subscriber runs yet
        Note over Svc,Out: BEFORE_COMMIT, same transaction, in @Order
        Pub->>OLS: onTeamSucceeded(event), @Order(10)
        OLS-->>Pub: orders confirmed
        Pub->>Out: onTeamSucceeded(event), lowest precedence
        Out-->>Pub: outbox row recorded (A.13: @sec-a-notifications)
    end
    Note over Svc,Out: COMMIT; AFTER_COMMIT subscribers then run (share credit, cache eviction: @fig-a-uc04-ds-events)
    Note over Relay,Topic: every 2 s under the job lease (S7): relayBatch reads up to 100 due outbox rows
    Relay->>Topic: PublishBatch(topicArn, entries), via OutboxEventTransport.publish(events, leaseValid)
    Topic-->>Relay: successful and failed ids; relayBatch records the results
    Note over Topic,Con: SNS delivers a copy to the notification SQS queue, asynchronously; the consumer long-polls it
    Topic-)Con: copy on the notification SQS queue
    Note over Con,Hdl: IntegrationEventDecoder.decode(body) yields a NotificationEvent
    Con->>Hdl: handle(consumer, event)
    Note over Con,Hdl: one transaction: markConsumed, then recordBatch (@sec-a-notifications)
    alt first delivery
        Hdl-->>Con: APPLIED
    else duplicate eventId
        Hdl-->>Con: DUPLICATE
    end
    Note over Con,Hdl: message deleted; a failure leaves it for redelivery, then the DLQ after 5 receives
